# ==========================================
# NOVA-AGENT ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# Updated: January 4, 2026
# ==========================================

# ===== OpenRouter Configuration (RECOMMENDED) =====
# Get your API key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Free models available - zero cost for testing and production!
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-YOUR-KEY-HERE
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# Optional: For app tracking on OpenRouter leaderboards
HTTP_REFERER=https://nova-agent.local
X_TITLE=Nova Agent

# ===== DeepSeek Configuration (Optional) =====
# Get your API key at: https://platform.deepseek.com
# Ultra low cost: $0.27/$0.41 per 1M tokens
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat
# Alternatives: deepseek-r1, deepseek-v3.2, deepseek-v3.2-speciale

# ===== Google Gemini Configuration (Optional) =====
# Get your API key at: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# Free tier: gemini-2.0-flash (60 RPM)
# Paid tier: gemini-3-pro, gemini-2.5-pro
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# ===== Groq Configuration (Optional) =====
# Get your API key at: https://console.groq.com
# Fast inference with tool calling support
GROQ_API_KEY=

# ===== Database Configuration =====
# Directory where SQLite databases are stored
DATABASE_PATH=D:\databases

# ===== Workspace Configuration =====
# Root directory for development projects
WORKSPACE_ROOT=C:\dev

# ===== DeepCode WebSocket Configuration =====
# WebSocket URL for DeepCode integration (if using)
DEEPCODE_WS_URL=ws://127.0.0.1:5004

# ===== Trading Bot Configuration (if using crypto-enhanced) =====
TRADING_DATA_DIR=D:\trading_data
TRADING_LOGS_DIR=D:\trading_logs

# ==========================================
# QUICK START GUIDE
# ==========================================
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env:
#    cp .env.example .env
#
# 2. Get OpenRouter API key:
#    https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# 3. Add your key to OPENROUTER_API_KEY above
#
# 4. Start nova-agent:
#    pnpm tauri dev
#
# 5. Test with FREE models first (zero cost):
#    - xiaomi/mimo-v2-flash:free (#1 on SWE-bench)
#    - mistralai/devstral-2512:free (agentic coding)
#    - kwaipilot/kat-coder-pro:free (73.4% SWE-bench)
#
# 6. Monitor usage:
#    https://openrouter.ai/activity
#
# ==========================================
# COST OPTIMIZATION
# ==========================================
#
# FREE MODELS (Zero Cost):
#   - All OpenRouter models with ":free" suffix
#   - No credit card required
#   - Production-ready performance
#   - Rate limits: ~10-20 RPM per model
#   - Strategy: Cascade through multiple free models
#
# PAID MODELS (Optional):
#   - anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5: $3/$15 per 1M (best overall)
#   - deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-speciale: $0.27/$0.41 per 1M (best value)
#   - anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5: $0.25/$1.25 per 1M (fast + cheap)
#   - google/gemini-2.5-flash: $0.075/$0.30 per 1M (ultra cheap)
#
# Add $5-10 credit at https://openrouter.ai for paid model access
#
# ==========================================
# TROUBLESHOOTING
# ==========================================
#
# Error: "No API key"
#   → Add OPENROUTER_API_KEY to .env file
#
# Error: "All providers failed"
#   → Check API key validity at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#   → Verify balance at https://openrouter.ai/credits
#   → Check rate limits at https://openrouter.ai/activity
#
# Error: "Model not found"
#   → Use exact model IDs from OPENROUTER_MODEL_CONFIG.md
#   → Free models must include ":free" suffix
#
# Error: "Tool calling not supported"
#   → Some free models don't support tools
#   → Use xiaomi/mimo-v2-flash:free or mistralai/devstral-2512:free
#
# Need help?
#   → Documentation: C:\dev\apps\nova-agent\OPENROUTER_MODEL_CONFIG.md
#   → Model list: https://openrouter.ai/models
#   → Support: https://openrouter.ai/support
#
